WEBVTT

00:00:07.005 --> 00:00:08.757
[whines]

00:00:11.927 --> 00:00:14.137
-Wow!
-Another Night Fury.

00:00:14.888 --> 00:00:16.556
No, not quite. It's more like a...

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:19.392
-Bright Fury.
-A Light Fury.

00:00:20.185 --> 00:00:22.604
Yeah, yours is better, probably.

00:00:22.896 --> 00:00:24.522
[whines softly]

00:00:25.232 --> 00:00:26.566
[Snotlout] What do you mean, gone?

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:28.193
Vanished. Into thin air.

00:00:28.276 --> 00:00:29.277
What do ya think?

00:00:29.736 --> 00:00:32.322
Uh-uh. Stubbier ears. No dorsal plates.

00:00:32.405 --> 00:00:33.865
-[Fishlegs] Okay. Got it.
-[Eret chuckles]

00:00:33.949 --> 00:00:35.283
What a night.

00:00:35.951 --> 00:00:37.535
-Bud, what's gotten into you?
-[panting]

00:00:37.619 --> 00:00:39.913
What is all this slobbering and panting?

00:00:39.996 --> 00:00:41.414
Isn't it obvious?

00:00:41.498 --> 00:00:42.999
He's in love.

00:00:44.251 --> 00:00:47.170
Trust me, relationships are nothing
but pain and misery.

00:00:47.379 --> 00:00:48.546
[scoffs]

00:00:48.797 --> 00:00:49.965
What did I just say?

00:00:51.341 --> 00:00:52.634
Am... Am I not enough?

00:00:53.677 --> 00:00:54.719
[grunts]

00:00:54.803 --> 00:00:56.554
I think that's a no.

00:00:57.847 --> 00:00:59.933
[purring and warbling]

00:01:06.523 --> 00:01:08.275
[purrs softly]

00:01:08.441 --> 00:01:10.026
-[Fishlegs] Something like this?
-You know what?

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:11.695
Just trace your Toothless card
and make her white.

00:01:11.778 --> 00:01:12.821
You could've led with that.

00:01:12.904 --> 00:01:16.074
Can you believe it?
Toothless has a girlfriend.

00:01:16.157 --> 00:01:17.909
I never took you for a romantic.

00:01:18.576 --> 00:01:19.577
Like, ever.

00:01:19.661 --> 00:01:21.538
[scoffs] But it's so sweet.

00:01:21.621 --> 00:01:22.998
I mean, look.

00:01:25.375 --> 00:01:27.168
[purring]

00:01:27.836 --> 00:01:29.337
[grunts]

00:01:29.421 --> 00:01:30.964
[purring]

00:01:31.047 --> 00:01:34.259
[chuckles] Okay.
That's just sad. And weird.

00:01:34.342 --> 00:01:36.136
Yeah, you better do something.

00:01:36.219 --> 00:01:39.723
Seriously? I'd rather shovel poop all day
than watch that.

00:01:39.806 --> 00:01:43.059
All right. Let's head back to the woods
and see if we can find her.

00:01:44.519 --> 00:01:46.104
[grunting happily]

00:01:46.479 --> 00:01:48.898
Ah, good idea. A little privacy.

00:01:49.065 --> 00:01:50.442
-Uh...
-Shh.

00:01:50.817 --> 00:01:51.818
It's boy talk.

00:01:51.901 --> 00:01:53.945
-What?
-Come on, let's go work this out.

00:01:54.029 --> 00:01:56.364
[Tuffnut] So, you wanna get married.

00:01:56.448 --> 00:01:57.449
[Hiccup] Uh, no, actually.

00:01:57.532 --> 00:01:59.284
Good news. I've been to two weddings.

00:01:59.367 --> 00:02:03.204
I crashed both,
but none as high profile as this one.

00:02:03.288 --> 00:02:06.082
Lots of pressure, judgment.
And not just by me.

00:02:06.166 --> 00:02:08.418
Look, we talked about it.
We're not getting married.

00:02:08.501 --> 00:02:11.171
Cold feet. I've seen it before.

00:02:11.254 --> 00:02:13.548
Don't worry, Little Hiccy. I'm here.

00:02:14.883 --> 00:02:15.925
Wait, Hiccy?

00:02:16.009 --> 00:02:17.844
Now, I've seen the way
Astrid looks at you.

00:02:17.927 --> 00:02:19.554
Everyone has that doubt.

00:02:19.637 --> 00:02:21.306
That not-so-subtle disappointment.

00:02:21.389 --> 00:02:24.309
That longing for something more than you.

00:02:24.392 --> 00:02:25.477
You need to focus on being worthy.

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:28.188
I mean, she's a warrior queen,
for Thor's sake.

00:02:28.271 --> 00:02:30.356
And you are neither.

00:02:30.857 --> 00:02:32.275
But with me as your best man,

00:02:32.358 --> 00:02:34.235
your spirit guide, if you will,

00:02:34.319 --> 00:02:37.238
you'll learn to embrace your inner Viking.

00:02:37.322 --> 00:02:39.657
Show these naysayers
of which there are many,

00:02:39.741 --> 00:02:42.452
that you're more
than just a malnourished runt

00:02:42.535 --> 00:02:45.705
with bad hair, strange teeth
and a twig for a neck.

00:02:45.789 --> 00:02:48.124
[Hiccup] You're...
You're really bad at pep talks.

00:02:48.208 --> 00:02:50.335
Stop letting these insecurities

00:02:50.418 --> 00:02:51.669
-get the best of you.
-[sniffs and grunts]

00:02:51.753 --> 00:02:54.047
Everyone's watching. I mean, everyone.

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:56.341
You need to man up. Do as I do.

00:02:56.424 --> 00:02:58.927
It'll be hard, but you have my word.

00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:02.013
And until I break that word,
I won't give up!

00:03:02.931 --> 00:03:04.015
Hey.

00:03:04.099 --> 00:03:06.893
Hey! What am I wasting my time here?

00:03:06.976 --> 00:03:08.645
You see some shiny thing in the woods...

00:03:08.728 --> 00:03:09.729
Ooh, what is that?

00:03:18.363 --> 00:03:19.739
[whines softly]

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:22.534
-Toothless!
-[growls and pants]

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:23.743
Don't move a muscle.

00:03:25.245 --> 00:03:26.246
Hey!

00:03:27.372 --> 00:03:28.998
[both gasp]

00:03:29.707 --> 00:03:30.750
[growls]

00:03:31.668 --> 00:03:33.461
[panting]

00:03:35.421 --> 00:03:36.923
-Someone's here.
-Huh?

00:03:37.006 --> 00:03:40.051
He managed to slip past our scouts
and lay a trap in the woods.

00:03:40.135 --> 00:03:41.719
It ruined boy talk.

00:03:41.803 --> 00:03:42.804
[gasps]

00:03:42.971 --> 00:03:45.098
-Let me at him!
-Slow down, Gobber.

00:03:45.598 --> 00:03:48.143
Let's get a search team on the ground,
scouts in the air.

00:03:48.226 --> 00:03:50.103
Toothless and I will fly the coastline.

00:03:50.186 --> 00:03:53.982
Yeah, I wouldn't advise
taking Toothless anywhere, Chief.

00:03:54.065 --> 00:03:55.817
I know this handiwork.

00:03:56.401 --> 00:03:59.279
Grimmel the Grisly.
Famous back where I'm from.

00:03:59.362 --> 00:04:01.823
The smartest dragon hunter I ever met.

00:04:01.906 --> 00:04:03.992
Well, next to me, of course.

00:04:04.075 --> 00:04:07.078
He can't be that smart.
He left his trap unmanned.

00:04:07.245 --> 00:04:11.332
[chuckles] Nothing's accidental
when it comes to old Grimmel.

00:04:11.416 --> 00:04:15.128
He lives for the hunt.
To get inside the mind of his prey.

00:04:15.211 --> 00:04:16.880
To control its every choice.

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:19.174
It's all a game to him.

00:04:19.257 --> 00:04:21.176
Well, he doesn't know
who he's playing with.

00:04:21.259 --> 00:04:23.052
Yeah. We've dealt with his kind before.

00:04:23.636 --> 00:04:25.180
Don't underestimate him, Hiccup.

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:27.765
Mark my words. He'll be back.

00:04:28.349 --> 00:04:29.809
Then we'll be waiting for him.

00:04:36.107 --> 00:04:37.108
[blows]

00:04:44.407 --> 00:04:47.243
[quietly] All right. All right, come on,
give me a clue here.

00:04:47.327 --> 00:04:48.745
Give me a clue, Dad.

00:04:51.873 --> 00:04:53.875
[wood creaking softly]

00:04:59.047 --> 00:05:00.673
[quiet snoring]

00:05:04.802 --> 00:05:06.137
[quiet tap]

00:05:11.559 --> 00:05:14.145
Oh, I hope you don't mind
if I help myself?

00:05:15.563 --> 00:05:17.565
This is, mmm, quite good.

00:05:19.234 --> 00:05:21.069
That is impressive.

00:05:21.152 --> 00:05:22.487
But let me finish my drink.

00:05:25.281 --> 00:05:26.282
[grunts]

00:05:26.532 --> 00:05:27.533
Toothless!

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:32.914
-[exhales]
-What did you do to him?

00:05:33.081 --> 00:05:35.833
Eh, nothing that he won't sleep off.

00:05:37.585 --> 00:05:39.587
[sighs and chuckles]

00:05:39.796 --> 00:05:42.674
May I? Chief Hiccup. Hmm?

00:05:42.757 --> 00:05:44.175
Do I say Chief... [hiccups]

00:05:44.259 --> 00:05:47.011
Or do I call you Hiccup?
What do you prefer?

00:05:49.264 --> 00:05:52.976
You have no idea who I am, do you?

00:05:54.018 --> 00:05:55.561
Oh. [chuckles]

00:05:55.645 --> 00:05:57.730
Well, your father knew of me.

00:05:57.814 --> 00:06:00.108
Now, there was a chief.

00:06:00.608 --> 00:06:04.362
One of the greatest dragon hunters
to have ever lived.

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:07.782
What would he think of you?

00:06:07.865 --> 00:06:09.409
[chuckles]

00:06:11.452 --> 00:06:12.954
He had it right, you know.

00:06:13.037 --> 00:06:15.248
Making it his mission
to destroy the beasts,

00:06:15.331 --> 00:06:17.250
so that you could grow up
in a better world.

00:06:17.834 --> 00:06:19.252
He changed his mind.

00:06:19.627 --> 00:06:21.546
And look where that got him.

00:06:23.214 --> 00:06:24.716
So, let's get to the point.

00:06:26.342 --> 00:06:28.970
I am the Night Fury killer.

00:06:29.304 --> 00:06:32.598
I've hunted every last one, but yours.

00:06:33.558 --> 00:06:36.185
You are going to give me that dragon,
or I will--

00:06:36.269 --> 00:06:38.021
I will never give him up.

00:06:38.146 --> 00:06:39.772
[laughs]

00:06:40.523 --> 00:06:45.153
You wish dragons to live free among us
like equals?

00:06:46.988 --> 00:06:49.115
A toxic notion, my boy.

00:06:49.198 --> 00:06:52.827
History has shown
that we are the superior species.

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:56.748
What if word of your misguided ideas
were to spread?

00:06:57.415 --> 00:07:03.379
It would be the undoing of civilization
as we know it.

00:07:04.422 --> 00:07:05.715
Hmm.

